{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0eStory\u2733\ufe0e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world in the very future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a time when it is commonplace for stars and aliens to interact with each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, an alien from Dandera, have come to a villa on a planet called &quot;Pisella.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems that there are people from many different stars here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But once you communicate with them, they are all people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 30 days to spend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How should you spend your time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0eFeature\u2733\ufe0e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0eNovel Adventure Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0eLaid-back atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0e60min~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0eSF</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0eUnity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0eThis is not a love game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0eGuide Line\u2733\ufe0e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0eWhen live streaming this game, please include the game title and a link to the store page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0eYou can do live play of this game or draw fan art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0eIf you're going to draw fan art, it would be nice if you could play this game once before you draw it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0ePlease don't hurt anyone with this game or this game's fan art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0eMareffy hopes that this game (including the fan art) will be truly enjoyed by everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2733\ufe0ePlease do not take the materials in the game's folder outside the game.</p><p cla